{
  "$schema": "https://sinua.dev/schema/character-recipe-1.json",
  "$comment": "BUZZY, a small space-hero assistant: a rounded-square indigo helmet with an amber fin and chevron ear pods, a glass visor over a face screen, a voice core in the chest. The mouth is a voice line; the chest bars follow the level; while listening, sound arcs light at the ear pods with the user's level.",
